					bark("I mean...I mean it is a powerful tool to help the people's herds... of torax, that is. (Yes, she threatens to make the weather bad, or worse yet, send them to the Lurker, if they don't do her bidding.) Please, ask me no more. I am afraid Salkind will punish me. ");
